E. Tooling: Higgsfield CLI 1.1.26 installed (`higgsfield model list --json` once authenticated); companion skills install running. The boss must run `higgsfield auth login` in a browser. Discipline from the example kit worth adopting: discover models before generating, keep job IDs and resume instead of resubmitting, download outputs (a link is not an asset), 1-3 attempts per asset, log credits.

